udiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Matte-Tobacco_FUT003-TB","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-tb","label":"Matte Tobacco"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Matte-Crete_FUT003-CR","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-cr","label":"Matte Crete"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Matte-Ash_FUT003-HA","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-ha","label":"Matte Ash"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Matte-Anthracite_FUT003-AT","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-at","label":"Matte Anthracite"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Matte-Blackboard_FUT003-BB","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-bb","label":"Matte Blackboard"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Pink-Powder_FUT003-PP","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-fut003-pp","label":"Gloss Pink Powder"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Tortora_FUT003-TO","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-to","label":"Gloss Tortora"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Burnt-Sienna_FUT003-BS","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-bs","label":"Gloss Burnt Sienna"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Petrol_FUT003-PT","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-pt","label":"Gloss Petrol"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Sugar-Paper_FUT003-SP","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-sp","label":"Gloss Sugar Paper"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Hung-Pan---Gloss-Indigo_FUT003-IN","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut003-in","label":"Gloss Indigo"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div>Introducing Futura the latest evolution in bathroom design from Italian manufacturer Hatria. Winner of multiple international design awards, Futura embodies purity in form and performance. Its patented PURE VORTEX  flush delivers a powerful, rimless vortex flow that is remarkably quiet, redefining expectations of both functionality and acoustic comfort in the bathroom.</div><div>With its pared-back silhouette and flush inlet positioned discreetly at the front of the bowl, Futura presents an almost sculptural clarity”free from visible outlets or unnecessary detail. This is a toilet designed not to draw attention, but to elevate the spatial experience with quiet innovation, refined engineering, and a commitment to modern minimalism.</div><div><div>The Futura Wall Hung Pan (FUT003), in any gloss or matte coloured finish, can only be paired with standard-height in-wall cisterns with a frame. It is not recommended or warranted for use with low-level cisterns with a frame. </div><div>The Futura’s elongated, fully glazed channel ensures a controlled and powerful PURE VORTEX flush. In some applications, surplus water may remain in the channel after flushing and gradually empty into the toilet bowl as the channel clears.</div></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
